  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3114.05 Retention of Records. All records required to be maintained pursuant to these rules shall be retained for a minimum period of 5 years.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3118.07) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
